+
+# Record when each task was created and last changed
+
+- Every task has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-time strings; on `add` they are equal.
+- `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag` and `untag` set `updatedAt` to the time of the change.
+- The domain may not read the clock: `createTodoList` (outside the domain) takes an optional clock
+  (`() => Date`, defaulting to the system time) and the domain receives the timestamp as a string.
